              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pactum ratum est. The pact is valid."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ratus, rata, ratum, the participle of reor, to reckon. Ratum habēre, to ratify; prō ratā parte, in proportion, gives English pro rata."
            }
